onflicting. I need to verify the metrics again to confirm if the service is up or if there\'s a scraping problem. Let me try querying for the up metric again, maybe with a different job name or label. If that doesn\'t work, perhaps check other metrics to see if there\'s any data. If no metrics are present, the issue is likely with the service\'s exporter or Prometheus configuration. If metrics are present, then the up{} query might be incorrect. But given the previous result, I\'ll proceed to check the metrics again with the same query to confirm.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"query": "up{job=\\"user-service\\"}"}', 'name': 'get_metrics'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8a634323c49a0b1e', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 500, 'prompt_tokens': 4706, 'total_tokens': 5206, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfbeb-ec62-7523-b7b3-61d152329d99-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'get_metrics', 'args': {'query': 'up{job="user-service"}'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8a634323c49a0b1e', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 4706, 'output_tokens': 500, 'total_tokens': 5206}), ToolMessage(content='("{\'resultType\': \'vector\', \'result\': []}", 12)', id='a8e6cf60-b261-46cd-b9fb-0c00ac0d4bf9', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-8a634323c49a0b1e'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='54ea82cd-8c5e-43e7-8155-f9e6b155a77c')]]
